{
  "_notes": [
    "Group size is picked by encounterRules (below), by the number of the normal fight inside the current Act (1 = first normal fight of the Act; elites and bosses do not count). Then a group of that size is picked from the Act's pool. Never the same group twice in a row.",
    "encounterRules[act] = tiers. The tier used is the last one whose 'from' <= fight number. 'weights' = chance per group size (1 single, 2 pair, 3 trio, 4 quad). Act 1 never has trios; Acts 2-3 have trios only from the 4th (Act 2) / 3rd (Act 3) normal fight. Quads are not used by normal fights now (pools kept for later).",
    "Normal-fight scaling by group size: HP x1/x1/x0.75/x0.62/x0.55, damage x1/x1/x0.85/x0.72/x0.62.",
    "Max 5 enemies at once. Mother Mycelia summons 2 Sporelings; Great Slime splits into 5 Slimelets.",
    "Act 4: Rest -> Shop -> Event -> LEXICORE.",
    "Elites: never repeated within an act. An elite entry that is a list is a multi-enemy elite fight (Scrapipede, Hive Mind)."
  ],
